{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117163","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117163/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117163/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117163/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117163","id":4036234140,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Imxlh","number":117163,"title":"Fix editor infinite loop and crash in sub-inspector auto-open","user":{"login":"RicardoHenriques123","id":117949565,"node_id":"U_kgDOBwfEfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117949565?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RicardoHenriques123","html_url":"https://github.com/RicardoHenriques123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RicardoHenriques123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RicardoHenriques123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RicardoHenriques123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RicardoHenriques123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RicardoHenriques123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RicardoHenriques123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RicardoHenriques123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RicardoHenriques123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RicardoHenriques123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-03-06T21:23:43Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T13:16:20Z","closed_at":"2026-06-23T19:31:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117163","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117163","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117163.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117163.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes\r\nFixes #116523\r\n\r\nDescription\r\nUnfolding a resource that automatically opens a bottom panel plugin triggered a synchronous inspector rebuild. If a custom EditorPlugin unconditionally returns true for _handles(), this resulted in a Use-After-Free crash or an infinite loop that locked the UI, as the inspector was being destroyed while iterating over its own properties.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes the issue by decoupling the bottom panel open logic from the manual fold toggle and tying it directly to the sub-inspector's state lifecycle in update_property(). When the edited object changes or is initialized from a previous state, it checks a new _has_external_editor() helper. If a plugin handles the resource, the _open_resource_editor call is deferred to the end of the frame.\r\n\r\nSteps to test\r\n\r\n    Download and extract the official MRP provided in issue #116523: editorplugin_issue_mrp.zip (also attached below).\r\n\r\n    Open the project in the compiled Godot Editor with this PR applied.\r\n\r\n    Verify that the included custom EditorPlugin (which globally intercepts resources) is enabled.\r\n\r\n    In the Scene tree, select the MeshInstance3D node.\r\n\r\n    In the Inspector dock, locate either the shadow_mesh or material property.\r\n\r\n    Click on the resource slot for shadow_mesh or material to unfold it in the inspector.\r\n\r\nExpected: The resource sub-inspector unfolds successfully. The Editor UI completes its layout update and remains completely stable.\r\nRegression: The Editor immediately crashes (Use-After-Free) or locks up in an infinite UI rebuild loop.\r\n\r\nAttachments\r\n[editorplugin_issue_mrp(1).zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25804672/editorplugin_issue_mrp.1.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117163/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117163/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}